], [101, 125491], [112, 126051], [116, 126231], [122, 126571], [126, 127026]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 127873, "end": 133496, "text": "And Judas Iscariot, which also betrayed him: and they went into a house.", "words": [[0, 127873], [4, 128021], [10, 128281], [20, 129181], [26, 129421], [31, 129781], [40, 130201], [45, 132087], [49, 132240], [54, 132340], [59, 132520], [64, 132760], [66, 132900]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 133946, "end": 138060, "text": "And the multitude comes together again, so that they could not so much as eat bread.", "words": [[0, 133946], [4, 134069], [8, 134149], [18, 134549], [24, 134929], [33, 135289], [40, 135709], [43, 136029], [48, 136229], [53, 136349], [59, 136469], [63, 136709], [66, 136929], [71, 137189], [74, 137349], [78, 137489]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 138510, "end": 144492, "text": "And when his friends heard of it, they went out to lay hold on him: for they said, He is beside himself.", "words": [[0, 138510], [4, 138641], [9, 138781], [13, 138941], [21, 139221], [27, 139481], [30, 139661], [34, 140001], [39, 140201], [44, 140381], [48, 140561], [51, 140741], [55, 140901], [60, 141121], [63, 141401], [68, 141986], [72, 142115], [77, 142295], [83, 143129], [86, 143272], [89, 143533], [96, 143853]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 144842, "end": 151654, "text": "¶ And the scribes which came down from Jerusalem said, He has Beelzebub, and by the prince of the demons casts he out demons.", "words": [[2, 144842], [6, 144974], [10, 145094], [18, 145594], [24, 145714], [29, 145974], [34, 146234], [39, 146434], [49, 147174], [55, 147810], [58, 147928], [62, 148278], [73, 148628], [77, 148948], [80, 149188], [84, 149368], [91, 149628], [94, 149788], [98, 149888], [105, 150128], [111, 150548], [114, 150868], [118, 151068]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 152004, "end": 157451, "text": "And he called them to him, and said to them in parables, How can Satan cast out Satan?", "words": [[0, 152004], [4, 152128], [7, 152207], [14, 152508], [19, 152748], [22, 152968], [27, 153228], [31, 153748], [36, 154008], [39, 154188], [44, 154368], [47, 154528], [57, 155600], [61, 155739], [65, 155939], [71, 156259], [76, 156639], [80, 156879]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 157901, "end": 161586, "text": "And if a kingdom be divided against itself, that kingdom cannot stand.", "words": [[0, 157901], [4, 157997], [7, 158117], [9, 158217], [17, 158457], [20, 158657], [28, 159037], [36, 159337], [44, 160097], [49, 160217], [57, 160537], [64, 160917]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 162036, "end": 165525, "text": "And if a house be divided against itself, that house cannot stand.", "words": [[0, 162036], [4, 162140], [7, 162240], [9, 162340], [15, 162540], [18, 162740], [26, 163080], [34, 163400], [42, 164240], [47, 164380], [53, 164640], [60, 164860]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 165975, "end": 171601, "text": "And if Satan rise up against himself, and be divided, he cannot stand, but has an end.", "words": [[0, 165975], [4, 166101], [7, 166241], [13, 166561], [18, 166881], [21, 167161], [29, 167441], [38, 168001], [42, 168421], [45, 168601], [54, 169501], [57, 169601], [64, 169941], [71, 170461], [75, 170861], [79, 171081], [82, 171201]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 172051, "end": 180299, "text": "No man can enter into a strong man’s house, and spoil his goods, unless he will first bind the strong man; and then he will spoil his house.", "words": [[0, 172051], [3, 172275], [7, 172595], [11, 172815], [17, 173135], [22, 173375], [24, 173515], [31, 173795], [37, 174235], [44, 174495], [48, 174975], [54, 175315], [58, 175555], [65, 175895], [72, 176475], [75, 176695], [80, 176815], [86, 177075], [91, 177375], [95, 177595], [102, 177835], [107, 178671], [111, 178789], [116, 178969], [119, 179129], [124, 179269], [130, 179569], [134, 179809]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 180749, "end": 188324, "text": "Assuredly I say to you, All sins shall be forgiven to the sons of men, and whatever blasphemies they may utter:", "words": [[0, 180749], [10, 181314], [12, 181454], [16, 181654], [19, 181834], [24, 182294], [28, 182634], [33, 182974], [39, 183274], [42, 183414], [51, 183794], [54, 184014], [58, 184134], [63, 184374], [66, 184574], [71, 185114], [75, 185294], [84, 185534], [96, 186354], [101, 186534], [105, 186714]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 188774, "end": 195770, "text": "But he that shall blaspheme against the Holy Spirit has never forgiveness, but is in danger of eternal damnation:", "words": [[0, 188774], [4, 188900], [7, 189180], [12, 189600], [18, 189880], [28, 190620], [36, 190860], [40, 191100], [45, 191320], [52, 191780], [56, 192040], [62, 192360], [75, 193220], [79, 193580], [82, 193720], [85, 193900], [92, 194260], [95, 194580], [103, 194980]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 196120, "end": 198935, "text": "Because they said, He has an unclean spirit.", "words": [[0, 196120], [8, 196377], [13, 196657], [19, 197412], [22, 197529], [26, 197729], [29, 197849], [37, 198329]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 199285, "end": 204706, "text": "¶ There came then his brethren and his mother, and, standing without, sent to him, calling him.", "words": [[2, 199285], [8, 199399], [13, 199699], [18, 199959], [22, 200179], [31, 200599], [35, 200939], [39, 201139], [47, 201959], [52, 202079], [61, 202519], [70, 203279], [75, 203459], [78, 203679], [83, 203979], [91, 204259]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 205156, "end": 211335, "text": "And the multitude sat about him, and they said to him, Behold, your mother and your brethren without seek for you.", "words": [[0, 205156], [4, 205301], [8, 205401], [18, 205841], [22, 206321], [28, 206641], [33, 207141], [37, 207321], [42, 207461], [47, 207721], [50, 207941], [55, 208422], [63, 208784], [68, 208944], [75, 209244], [79, 209524], [84, 209644], [93, 210044], [101, 210524], [106, 210844], [110, 211064]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 211685, "end": 216108, "text": "And he answered them, saying, Who is my mother, or my brethren?", "words": [[0, 211685], [4, 211840], [7, 212000], [16, 212340], [22, 212680], [30, 214